{"script":"s_4_13_1_n","exps":[{"para":{"tag":"tag_1"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"layer":"chara2"},"key":"top"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"巨木侍女阿碧约格","text":"[show]我看看……手上的材料可还不够哟……[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_2"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"巨木侍女阿碧约格","text":"[show]你知道晚上被光照到的痛苦吗？哪怕闭上眼睛都能感受到一阵阵的闪光，别说睡觉，就是正常打个盹都很难。[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_3"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"巨木侍女阿碧约格","text":"[show]拜托两位快点啦……不然我眼睛旁的黑色又要大一圈了……[l][cm][hide]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_4"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"","text":"[hide]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"end":true},"key":"end"}],"des":"（提交粗布和皮革。）"}